# 跨平台统一：脚本/配置保持 LF（Windows 上 checkout 也用 LF，避免 deb/rules、.sh 坏掉）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
rules text eol=lf
postinst text eol=lf
prerm text eol=lf
postrm text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text
*.deb binary
